seeking roofer (public bid - roof patching, flashing, sealant, downspouts within a freezer structural repair) | Open public bid | ~2026-10-09 (Iowa DAS notice; first found by this search 11/2) | bids due Tue 11/17/2026 2:00 PM CST via IMPACS; questions due 11/4 10:00 AM
RFB #950300-01 WRC CDC Freezer Repair: re-grading, concrete, structural steel repairs, ROOF PATCHING, sealant, flashing and downspout modifications at the Woodward Resource Center, 1251 334th St, Woodward IA. Bids due 11/17/2026 2:00 PM on IMPACS (5% bid security); optional pre-bid was 10/28. Construction 12/21/2026-6/30/2027. Roofing is a partial scope (likely a sub to a GC). Notice posted ~10/9; first found by this search 11/2. Separate from the carried WRC Dispatch Garage design RFP.
Contact: Katelyn Howells, Issuing Officer
Phone: 515-721-7856
